text: >-
  THE TIMES OF ISRAEL

  ISRAEL AT WAR - DAY 739

  OCTOBER 14, 2025

  CURRENT TOP STORIES

  • LIVE

  Bodies of hostages

  returned by Hamas

  confirmed as Guy

  Illouz, Bipin Joshi

  and 2 others

  By TOI STAFF

  IDF: 5 Palestinians killed in Gaza City

  had crossed ceasefire line, neared

  troops * Report: Israel demanding

  progress today on return of dead

  hostages' bodies, but lacks leverage

  15min ago

  Israeli gymnasts to remain excluded

  from world championship after

  sport's highest court rejects request

  16min ago

  Israel says pressure on Hamas will

  continue, intensify until bodies of all

  dead hostages returned

  47min ago

  Erdogan says he believes Gulf, US

  and Europe will quickly provide

  financing for Gaza reconstruction

  1hr ago

  IDF: Bodies of hostages returned by

  Hamas confirmed as Guy Illouz, Bipin

  Joshi and 2 others

  • LIVE UPDATE → FROM THE LIVEBLOG OF THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 11, 2025

  US authorities say have 'good

  video footage' of Charlie Kirk

  suspect

  By AFP

  11 September 2025, 5:19 pm

  • SHARE

  US investigators said Thursday they are confident they will identify the

  gunman who shot dead right-wing influencer Charlie Kirk at a university in

  Utah, having gathered images of the suspect.

  "We do have good video footage of this individual. We are not going to

  release that at this time," Beau Mason, commissioner of the Utah

  Department of Public Safety, told reporters.

  "We are working through some technologies and some ways to identify

  this individual," he said, adding that "we are confident in our abilities
  right

  noW."

