  SEASONAL

  SPECIALS

  LET'S GO

  BONEFISH

  BONEFISH

  GRILL

  DYNAMITE SALMON

  Wood-grilled Atlantic salmon topped with creamy

  spinach, mushroom & lump crab dynamite, served

  with broccoli and jasmine rice.

  Skip Ad

  "We have recovered what we believe is the weapon that was used in

  yesterday's shooting. It is a high powered bolt action rifle," FBI agent

  Robert Bohls tells a media briefing, adding that "we have images of the

  suspect."

  "We're doing everything we can to find him, and we're not sure how far he

  has gone yet, but we will, we will do our best," the agent said.

  SCROLL TO VIEW MORE
